{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0203_1000_p", "source_sha256": "79831dfc4bcc442450e822f9a81d22b8823af43a2bcd9336a218ad3e43ad5e15", "ja": "（今日は『アイグラ！！』の撮影なのだが、着替えを\n終えた瑞希が、なにやらそわそわしているな……）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄《偶像写真！！》，换好衣服的瑞希好像有些坐立不安啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0203_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "d88f63295e94b92dd5f1dcfc03e8d90510f74c7163bb41a68335b60cd2683c39", "ja": "メーデー、メーデー。{$P$}、\n聞きたい事があります。", "zh": "Mayday，Mayday。{$P$}，我有件事想问您。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0203_1002_044miz", "source_sha256": "0a71e02016a56257ea5b466b2266052d3988102dc4b29af631a9633fb2c22c11", "ja": "このチャイナ服衣装、私に似合っているでしょうか？\nとても、気になります。", "zh": "这身旗袍服装，适合我吗？\n我非常在意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0203_1003_p", "source_sha256": "5cd42873bce602c5ce5f6ee0ff550ee9c9e799b75f1d806b8d6512736a4105cb", "ja": "もちろんだ。バッチリ似合ってると思うよ。", "zh": "当然了。我觉得特别适合你哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0203_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "010094ad13ec3ef45e258558d04e271af6e97ca8672ae34cbf6d48e92fc9562b", "ja": "本当ですか？　……本当に？", "zh": "真的吗？……真的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0203_1005_p", "source_sha256": "7d5155d608e2aada583f28c74399de64675348c77c6a40256155410d8325486c", "ja": "大丈夫だ、本当だよ。\n何か、気になることでもあったのか？", "zh": "没事的，是真的。\n是有什么让你在意的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0203_1006_044miz", "source_sha256": "b5faeaf8b50d81dcfb86949d02d35d921d7d49cf6ac9993f159572b14660ca2d", "ja": "はい。チャイナ服の魅力と言えば、\n真っ先に思い浮かべるのは……セクシー。", "zh": "是的。说到旗袍的魅力，首先想到的就是……性感。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0203_1007_044miz", "source_sha256": "a8db56693d3cdbb5b4a95a6cd1b75a79590c3fe0eba96d94857ff714f091e0f4", "ja": "服が体にフィットしていて、スカートには\nスリットもあります。……ぽっ。", "zh": "衣服贴合身体曲线，裙子上还有开衩。……嗯，脸红了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0203_1008_p", "source_sha256": "36ef04bbb6f295bc87776ae8462372478dd4688e6d1e3380916d984da2ec2274", "ja": "そうだな。瑞希の言うとおり、\nセクシーさも魅力のひとつだと思うよ。", "zh": "是啊。正如瑞希所说，我觉得性感也是魅力之一。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0203_1009_044miz", "source_sha256": "1ae8b1e193b1bd02e91b6ea376d059b256f1254afeb3ab1e0956a31ce31373e4", "ja": "はい。ですが私は、ボディラインにはあまり……\nそれほど、自信がありません。", "zh": "是的。不过，我对自己的身材曲线……没那么有自信。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0203_1010_044miz", "source_sha256": "089cbddff1a82b971adcf8442c3bf244bbe3bc951285018d4df048fa770f82f3", "ja": "なので、どんなセクシーポーズで撮影すればいいか、\nわからなくて。……しゅん。", "zh": "所以，我不知道该摆什么样的性感姿势来拍……有点沮丧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0203_1011_p", "source_sha256": "f9230b1550429062baba74ed6f6ffa419a3994abc720637f3c85f7f6c0ab6037", "ja": "なるほど、それで悩んでたのか……。でも、\nチャイナ服の魅力はセクシーさだけじゃないと思うよ。", "zh": "原来如此，你就是在为这个烦恼啊……不过，我觉得旗袍的魅力并不只有性感。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0203_1012_044miz", "source_sha256": "87a2bb4a6bcfdedec204bb0c36a927568bf326f82abbc2322e4e384564cbfe3d", "ja": "セクシーさ以外の魅力、ですか。それは……？", "zh": "除了性感之外的魅力吗？那就是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0203_1013_p", "source_sha256": "fd4e3ff80aee2c273fc00963c5512abca4fa3537f4a13c758910b89d7198cc8e", "ja": "体のラインがくっきりしてたり、スリットが空いてる\nってことは、動きやすいって事だと思うんだ。", "zh": "身材曲线清晰，或者开着开衩，意味着活动起来会更方便。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0203_1014_044miz", "source_sha256": "6133eab165a783418256e81bfbc4e296e34ae3ec05bf33ae6232b55342b93744", "ja": "はっ。つまり、動きのあるポーズで、\n衣装も映えると……？", "zh": "啊。也就是说，要摆出有动感的姿势，服装也会更显眼……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0203_1015_044miz", "source_sha256": "bbd6480cc57ab8080028bc97e5014692b1668cf0e607b7741e311a896f5accdc", "ja": "それでは……{$P$}。\nこんな感じは、どうでしょうか。あちょー。", "zh": "那么……{$P$}。像这样，怎么样？喝——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0203_1016_044miz", "source_sha256": "a1c32f963bac1cc6cfba4c570b94808926a8f5e62dfec2b6e6f95b9969557f18", "ja": "どうですか？　……カッコイイでしょうか？", "zh": "怎么样？……很帅气吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0203_1017_p", "source_sha256": "fd905439890e06ec17027e8db0f71c9818b9a167f4215da760e000c84033d577", "ja": "ああ！　瑞希はスタイルもいいし、\n迫力があっていいと思うよ。", "zh": "啊！瑞希的身材也很好，\n很有气势，我觉得很不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0203_1018_044miz", "source_sha256": "544de2a0ecc158ada1c683ae1ea92575ec66d6c3b77a7ceee78e5b6b5d32c215", "ja": "ありがとうございます。この衣装での撮影に、\nすこし自信が持てました。……やったぞ、瑞希。", "zh": "非常感谢。对于穿着这套服装拍摄，\n我稍微有了些自信。……干得好，瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
